                                                "example_id": "bfe56e52-257a-4b18-a28a-c05c336a5d60",
                                                "sense_id": "485fb3ad-ce4a-3feb-9b8f-f235baed4017",
                                                "text": "“[…] I don't have her creative genius or her version. I'm a numbers man, like my father. A pencil pusher, as Amanda said.” With no balls, he added silently."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "85aa0212-be78-4d7c-9b36-7b4b588241bd",
                                                "sense_id": "485fb3ad-ce4a-3feb-9b8f-f235baed4017",
                                                "text": "The internal investigator for the Macon Police Department had the dour, lifeless personality of a career pencil pusher."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
